ng couple are eager to take the next step. Spring break passes, however, with neither able to make the first move. Upon entering their third and final year of middle school, the two are regrettably put into separate classes. Alas, unable to spend as much time together as before, they both begin to grow apart.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bYQAlrnKE4mfQyf1hj5fi67JSNu.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16457","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"136934","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49470","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"129516","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"415240","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"65063","synopsis":"It's Yume and Mizuto's first summer together as stepsiblings. Their parents are unable to return home one night due to a typhoon. Now alone in the house together, trouble arises when Yume spots a certain creepy crawly in her room. On another day, Mizuto accompanies Yume clothes shopping for a swimsuit in preparation for an upcoming family trip to the countryside. It's in situations like these that the two seem to be finding themselves reminiscing about the past more and more...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vCsff2IbMCMd6GLWCmckpT58yEz.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"It's Yume and Mizuto's first summer together as stepsiblings. Their parents are unable to return home one night due to a typhoon. Now alone in the house together, trouble arises when Yume spots a certain creepy crawly in her room. On another day, Mizuto accompanies Yume clothes shopping for a swimsuit in preparation for an upcoming family trip to the countryside. It's in situations like these that the two seem to be finding themselves